<title>USA: Keystone Financial Q1 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>Keystone Financial Q1 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Pa. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.44</p>
<p> Net			 17,129		   16,857</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  37,553		   37,950</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Keystone Financial Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 return on average assets was 1.34 percent, while return on average equity was 13.91 percent. (Q1 1996 comparison figures not provided.)</p>
<p>Assets at the close of Q1 1997 were $5.2 billion against $5.0 billion for Q1 1996. Loans for Q1 1997 were $3.5 billion, against $3.4 billion a year ago.</p>
